-<!DOCTYPE html>
-<html>
-<head>
-<title>HTML Templates: 'In body' insertion mode: when template end tag is met, implied end tags should be generated</title>
-<meta name="author" title="Sergey G. Grekhov" href="mailto:sgrekhov@unipro.ru">
